  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT THE STRUCTURAL REFORM PROGRAM OF THE FINANCIAL SECTOR AND PROVIDE FINANCING WITHIN THE CONTEXT OF THE GOVERNMENT&apos;S ENHANCED STRUCTURAL ADJUSTMENT FACILITY (ESAF) AGREEMENT WITH THE IMF. FAST DISBURSEMENT OPERATION WITH THREE TRANCHES. THE SECTOR&apos;S MEDIUM-TERM VISION IS: (1) LUQUIDATION OR PRIVATIZATION OF STATE BANKS; (2) MODERNIZATION OF LEGAL AND REGULATORY STRUCTURE; (3) MODERNIZATION OF INSTIT. AND NORMATIVE FRAMEWORK FOR PRUDENTIAL REGULATION AND SUPERVISION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
